Total: 3 streams, 5639 events, 16h 0m direct.
Nothing was written. A date_range name is usually a real initiative bucketed into a week:
strip the suffix with 'tt streams rename', then collapse the weeks with 'tt streams merge'.
Only a name that never described work belongs in 'tt streams dissolve'.
